{"timestamp": "2026-07-23T20:30:55.598753", "benchmark": "gaia2", "group": "curated_patch", "phase": "test", "task_id": "gaia2_scenario_universe_21_44vlco", "task_desc": "I have a photoshoot this Friday from 7pm-8pm with a bakery brand called Sheryl's Sweets, can you schedule the event and add the person I had a brand partnership meeting with yesterday. I think I recall that the location of the photoshoot will be at the Östermalm Oasis property so book a premium ride there from my house 20 minutes before the photoshoot, but also check with my social media strategist Luísa Silva e Sousa in an email to make sure I heard her right about the location and time of the ", "augmented_prompt": "", "response": "I'll break down this task into sub-requests:\n1. Schedule a calendar event for Friday 7pm-8pm photoshoot with Sheryl's Sweets\n2. Add the person from yesterday's brand partnership meeting to the event\n3. Book a premium ride from my house to Östermalm Oasis 20 min before the photoshoot\n4. Email social media strategist Luísa Silva e Sousa to confirm location/time\n5. Notify user when email is sent\n6. If info is wrong, update cab booking and calendar event\n\nLet me start by gathering information. First, let me check the calendar for yesterday's meeting, find Luísa's contact, and get my current location details.\nI found the key information:\n- **Yesterday's brand partnership meeting** (Oct 14, 14:00-16:00) had attendee **Åke Svensson** — that's the person to add.\n- **Luísa Silva e Sousa** (Social Media Strategist) — email: luisa.silvaesousa@gaia2mail.com\n- **My house** (Astrid Lundqvist): Östermalmsgatan 12, 114 39 Stockholm, Sweden\n- **Friday** = Oct 18, 2024. Photoshoot 19:00-20:00. Ride 20 min before = 18:40.\n\nLet me verify the Östermalm Oasis property location and check the cab quotation. Let me also confirm the date for Friday.\nI have all the details I need:\n- **Östermalm Oasis** location: Valhallavägen 22, Stockholm\n- Friday Oct 18: photoshoot 19:00-20:0